## Setup

```bash
uv sync --group dev
pre-commit install
```

## Run tests

```bash
uv run pytest
```

## CI runner

By default this repo uses GitHub-hosted runners. To use the local self-hosted
runner pool:

```bash
./scripts/set-runner.sh self-hosted
```

To switch back:

```bash
./scripts/set-runner.sh github
```

